  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Capacity of Palestinian Stone and Marble Center (Phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Revision of Project 106029 (Phase II) - The project supports the Palestinian Stone and Marble Center (PSMC) to enhance its sustainability and effectiveness as a technical support centre for the development of Palestine#s stone manufacturing base. The project consists of technical assistance to PSMC to develop its strategic and managerial abilities to oversee programs and respond pro-actively to customer needs as well as align its technical competencies to deliver a wider range of quality services, develop industry-related innovative applications and educate future workforce for the stone industry.</narrative>
  </description>
